Hi,
I'm trying to use shiny to create google charts like the one describe here: http://shiny.rstudio.com/gallery/google-charts.html. My problem is that i'm using RmySQL to retrieve my data from my server and fill the chart with those data. It works fine on R but when i try to plug my chart into a webpage (by using shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io>) it doesn't work. I think that's because the app can not connect to my server.
What do you think ? Does anyone has any solution to my problem ?
Thanks.

