My name is Luke Green, and I'm the founder of Vivaldi Analytics <http://www.vivaldianalytics.com/>, a data analysis company specializing in survey analysis. I've just released the free version of our new app, Violin, a web application for exploring survey results. Feel free to try it out here <http://vivaldianalytics.shinyapps.io/Violin>, and let me know what you think!

For some examples of its uses, and some relationships you can explore using the sample dataset, see my new blog post here: https://vivaldidata.wordpress.com/2015/02/14/income-education-and-kindles/

